# Only the source goes into git: everything is ignored except what is listed below.
# Left out on purpose: saves and harvested saves (saves/, state/), test screenshots and logs, game files extracted
# from CA's and DeI's packs (work/), builds (build/; the pack, exe and missions file go into GitHub releases),
# the local venv, engine-research experiments (tools/ghidra), copies of the author's own config files (tests/backup).
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/INSTALL.txt
!/tools/
!/pack_src/
!/ui_src/
!/tests/
/tools/ghidra/
/tools/__pycache__/
/tools/vendor_ia/__pycache__/
/tests/*
!/tests/*.sh
!/tests/*.py
!/tests/*.lua
!/tests/*modlist.txt
